- The printed URL line (`urlLine`) goes to the dashboard's stdout, which the host agent's transcript captures when `/deliberation:dashboard` starts it.
- The state file (`statePath`) and the redirect page live under the user's cache dir (`<XDG cache>/deliberation/`), created 0700.
